  "title": "Bus timetable: Line 7",
  "text": "Line 7: City Centre – Airport\n\nDepartures from City Centre (stop: Main Square)\nMonday – Friday: every 20 minutes, from 5:00 to 23:00\nSaturday and Sunday: every 40 minutes, from 6:00 to 22:00\n\nThe journey takes 35 minutes.\n\nTickets: single ticket – 5 zł, 24-hour ticket – 15 zł\nBuy your ticket from the machine at the bus stop or in the app. You can't buy tickets from the driver.\n\nPlease note: on 1 and 3 May there are no buses after 20:00.",
